Image models and libraries
--------------------------
Downloaded to your device on first use and run there.
BiRefNet-lite by Peng Zheng and co-authors. MIT. https://github.com/ZhengPeng7/BiRefNet (background remover and subject finder; 512 px export by studioludens)
MODNet by Zhanghan Ke and co-authors. Apache-2.0. https://github.com/ZHKKKe/MODNet (fallback background remover)
LaMa by Roman Suvorov and co-authors. Apache-2.0. https://github.com/advimman/lama (Magic Eraser, Magic Grab, Grab Text; ONNX export by Carve)
Tesseract.js by Project Naptha and contributors. Apache-2.0. https://github.com/naptha/tesseract.js (Grab Text)
ONNX Runtime Web by Microsoft. MIT. https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime (runs the models)

